Wrong (B): Passive losses reduce NII; the NIIT does not apply to the gross $60,000 without netting the $25,000 passive loss.
Wrong (C): While W-2 wages are excluded from NII, net passive income of $35,000 exceeds zero and MAGI exceeds the threshold, so NIIT is owed.
Wrong (D): The NIIT applies to the lesser of NII or the MAGI excess, not automatically to the full $80,000 excess.$EXPL$
