  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (D): Under IRC Section 408A(d)(3)(F), converted amounts withdrawn within 5 years of conversion are subject to the 10% early withdrawal penalty if the taxpayer is under age 59-1/2. Garrett converted in 2024 and withdrew in 2026 (only 2 years), and at age 52 he is under the age threshold. The $80,000 is not taxed again but the 10% penalty applies.
